><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Matumoto</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Manabe</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>New method of evaluating the surgical margin and safety margin for musculoskeletal sarcoma, analysed on the basis of 457 surgical cases</article-title><source>J Cancer Res Clin Oncol</source><year>1995</year><volume>121</volume><issue>9-10</issue><fpage>555</fpage><lpage>63</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7559736</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R6"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kubo</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugita</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimose</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Arihiro</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ochi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Conservative surgery for well-differentiated liposarcomas of the extremities adjacent to major neurovascular structures</article-title><source>Surg Oncol</source><year>2006</year><volume>15</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>167</fpage><lpage>71</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17184990</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R7"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gerrand</surname><given-names>CH</given-names></name><name><surname>Wunder</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Kandel</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Classification of positive margins after resection of soft-tissue sarcoma of the limb predicts the risk of local recurrence</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Br</source><year>2001</year><volume>83</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>1149</fpage><lpage>55</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11764430</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sugiura</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Takahashi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Katagiri</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Additional wide resection of malignant soft tissue tumors</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>394</volume><fpage>201</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11795735</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pervaiz</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Colterjohn</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Farrokhyar</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Tozer</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Figueredo</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ghert</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A systematic meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials of adjuvant chemotherapy for localized resectable soft-tissue sarcoma</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>2008</year><volume>113</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>573</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18521899</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karavasilis</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Seddon</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ashley</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Al-Muderis</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Judson</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Significant clinical benefit of first-line palliative chemotherapy in advanced soft-tissue sarcoma: retrospective analysis and identification of prognostic factors in 488 patients</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>2008</year><volume>112</volume><issue>7</issue><fpage>1585</fpage><lpage>91</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18278813</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grier</surname><given-names>HE</given-names></name><name><surname>Krailo</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Tarbell</surname><given-names>NJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Addition of ifosfamide and etoposide to standard chemotherapy for Ewing's sarcoma and primitive neuroectodermal tumor of bone</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>348</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>694</fpage><lpage>701</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12594313</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kaplan</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name><name><surname>Meier</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nonparametric estimation from incomplete observations</article-title><source>J Am Statist Assoc</source><year>1958</year><volume>53</volume><issue>282</issue><fpage>457</fpage><lpage>81</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="R13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cox</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Regression models and life tables</article-title><source>J R Stat Soc Series B</source><year>1972</year><volume>34</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>187</fpage><lpage>220</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="R14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kepka</s